    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "pandas.Series.ndim# property Series.ndim[source]# Number of dimensions of the underlying data, by definition 1. Examples >>> s = pd.Series(['Ant', 'Bear', 'Cow']) >>> s 0 Ant 1 Bear 2 Cow dtype: object >>> s.ndim 1 For Index: >>> idx = pd.Index([1, 2, 3]) >>> idx Index([1, 2, 3], dtype='int64') >>> idx.ndim 1",
